<div data-type="note" id="fs-id1167066058611" class="misconception ui-has-child-title"><header><h3 class="os-title" data-type="title">
  <span class="os-title-label">Misconception Alert</span>
</h3></header><section>
<div class="os-note-body">

<p id="fs-id1167065937404">The density of the magnetic field lines in <a href="20-1-magnetic-fields-field-lines-and-force#Fi